oh-my-copilot-slim
==================

This project is an unofficial adaptation of oh-my-opencode-slim
(https://github.com/alvinunreal/oh-my-opencode-slim) for GitHub Copilot.
It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the oh-my-opencode-slim
authors, OpenCode, or GitHub.

Material derived from oh-my-opencode-slim
-----------------------------------------

The following files contain text adapted from oh-my-opencode-slim (branch master):

- agents/*.agent.md  - role prompts adapted from src/agents/role-prompts.ts,
                       src/agents/orchestrator.ts, src/agents/role-routing.ts,
                       src/agents/council.ts and src/agents/councillor.ts
- skills/codemap/SKILL.md - workflow adapted from src/skills/codemap/SKILL.md
                       (its Node script was replaced by git-based change detection)
- presets/github-copilot.json - preset shape follows the upstream configuration
                       format; the role values are the user-supplied preset
- skills/deepwork, skills/verification-planning, skills/worktrees,
  skills/clonedeps, skills/reflect, skills/loop-engineering
                     - adapted from src/skills/<name>/SKILL.md (master @ 0656d3ef)
- skills/oh-my-copilot-slim/SKILL.md - adapted from
                       src/skills/oh-my-opencode-slim/SKILL.md (self-config skill)
- extensions/oh-my-copilot-slim/lib/hooks.mjs and lib/council.mjs - council
                       trigger list, Council Mode procedure, phase reminder and
                       tool-loop guard adapted from src/hooks/{council-inject,
                       phase-reminder,tool-loop-guard}
- extensions/oh-my-copilot-slim/lib/commands.mjs - /deepwork, /reflect and /loop
                       prompt templates adapted from src/hooks/{deepwork,reflect,
                       loop-command}
- extensions/oh-my-copilot-slim/lib/astgrep.mjs - tool shape and output format
                       adapted from src/tools/ast-grep/
- extensions/oh-my-copilot-slim/lib/smartfetch.mjs - behavior adapted from
                       src/tools/smartfetch/ (reimplemented without Readability,
                       jsdom or turndown)
- extensions/oh-my-copilot-slim/lib/acp.mjs - ACP client handling adapted from
                       src/tools/acp-run.ts

These adaptations replace OpenCode-specific tools, hooks and permissions with
GitHub Copilot equivalents and are modified from the originals.

Independently authored (not copied from upstream or third parties)
------------------------------------------------------------------

- skills/simplify/SKILL.md - upstream's simplify skill is itself adapted from a
  third-party skill, so this project ships an independently written version.
- skills/pragmatic-engineering/SKILL.md - not an upstream bundled skill; written
  for this project.
- skills/interview/SKILL.md - workflow follows upstream's /interview
  (docs/interview.md); text written for this project.
- extensions/oh-my-copilot-slim/extension.mjs and the remaining lib/*.mjs
  modules (config, presets, prompts, policy, images, codegraph, doctor, core).
  Their behavior follows upstream documentation (configuration, presets,
  project-local customization, image routing) but the code is new.

