--------------------------------------------------------------------------

- CodeGraph (@colbymchenry/codegraph, https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph),
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Colby Mchenry. plugin.json starts version
  1.6.2 through npx, and omcs_codegraph_init runs its `init` command. No
  CodeGraph code or text is copied here; npm downloads it under its own license.
  CodeGraph is not affiliated with this project.
- ast-grep (@ast-grep/cli, https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2022 Herrington Darkholme. When no ast-grep binary is on PATH,
  the extension runs version 0.51.0 through npx. No ast-grep code is copied here.
